# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For many years I tracked my weight with %(hdo_link)s, created by "
"%(walker_link)s. It kept working for a good while after his death, but in "
"March 2026 it finally stopped."
msgstr ""
"I mange år fulgte jeg min vægt med %(hdo_link)s, skabt af %(walker_link)s. "
"Det blev ved med at virke længe efter hans død, men i marts 2026 holdt det "
"endelig op."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I tried %(yadt_link)s as a replacement, but its interface wasn't for me. So "
"I vibe-coded my own version, and Kilo Tracker is the result. It's free for "
"anyone to use."
msgstr ""
"Jeg prøvede %(yadt_link)s som erstatning, men dens grænseflade var ikke "
"noget for mig. Så jeg vibe-kodede min egen version, og Kilo Tracker er "
"resultatet. Det er gratis for alle."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Kilo Tracker is open source software. You can download the source code and "
"run your own copy from %(github_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Kilo Tracker er open source-software. Du kan downloade kildekoden og køre "
"din egen kopi fra %(github_link)s."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid "I hope you like it! You can reach me at %(mail_link)s."
msgstr "Jeg håber, du kan lide den! Du kan kontakte mig på %(mail_link)s."

# machine-translated
