# machine-translated
msgid "How signing in works"
msgstr "Sådan fungerer login"

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minute — enter it and you're signed in."
msgid_plural ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minutes — enter it and you're signed in."
msgstr[0] ""
"Der er ingen adgangskoder. Indtast din e-mailadresse, så sender vi en "
"6-cifret kode, der er gyldig i %(num)s minut – indtast den, og du er logget "
"ind."
msgstr[1] ""
"Der er ingen adgangskoder. Indtast din e-mailadresse, så sender vi en "
"6-cifret kode, der er gyldig i %(num)s minutter – indtast den, og du er "
"logget ind."

# machine-translated
msgid "Gravatar uses"
msgstr "Gravatar"

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We never store your email address itself in our database. Instead we keep a "
"one-way SHA-256 hash of it (the same scheme %(gravatar_hash_link)s)."
msgstr ""
"Vi gemmer aldrig selve din e-mailadresse i vores database. I stedet gemmer "
"vi en envejs SHA-256-hash af den (samme skema, som %(gravatar_hash_link)s "
"bruger)."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"That hash also doubles as your Gravatar id — if you have an avatar set up at"
" %(gravatar_link)s, it shows up automatically once you're signed in."
msgstr ""
"Den hash fungerer også som dit Gravatar-id – hvis du har sat en avatar op på"
" %(gravatar_link)s, vises den automatisk, når du er logget ind."

# machine-translated
msgid ""
"Kilo fetches that avatar from Gravatar itself and keeps a copy for a day, so"
" Gravatar never sees your visits, your browser or your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Kilo henter selv den avatar fra Gravatar og gemmer en kopi i en dag, så "
"Gravatar aldrig ser dine besøg, din browser eller din IP-adresse."

